1
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:12,279
Li Mingyuan!

2
00:00:14,839 --> 00:00:15,599
Lian Ye, stop!

3
00:00:15,919 --> 00:00:17,280
He murdered my whole family!

4
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,960
Wasn't your family's car crash an accident?

5
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,239
Li Zhenhai!

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,079
Back when my father was president,

7
00:00:26,719 --> 00:00:28,480
he banned all trade of raw opium!

8
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,359
Not a single bit of raw opium entered Rongcheng!

9
00:00:31,519 --> 00:00:33,039
Yet what happened after you took over?

10
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:36,200
Massive amounts of raw opium flooded into Rongcheng!

11
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,479
The Lian family's businesses and assets

12
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:40,159
all ended up in your pocket!

13
00:00:41,079 --> 00:00:43,640
The Charity Opium Cessation Clinic and underground opium dens—

14
00:00:44,119 --> 00:00:46,399
you're the real boss behind it all!

15
00:00:46,399 --> 00:00:47,920
If you didn't murder my family,

16
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:48,840
who else could it be?!

17
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:51,600
No, no! What underground opium dens?!

18
00:00:51,719 --> 00:00:54,320
Weren't the goods we discussed cessation pills?

19
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:56,000
The Charity Opium Cessation Clinic's pills—

20
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,560
some of them were secretly swapped for raw opium!

21
00:01:06,879 --> 00:01:08,040
I didn't know about that!

22
00:01:08,159 --> 00:01:09,439
I swear I had no idea!

23
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,920
Old Song just told me cessation pills sold well,

24
00:01:13,079 --> 00:01:14,719
so I only wanted a cut of the profits!

25
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:16,040
Then what about my family's Shoushan stone carving?

26
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,640
Why was it found in an underground opium den?!

27
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:20,000
What Shoushan stone carving?!

28
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,400
I don't even know of any underground opium dens!

29
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,560
I only handled the orders for the cessation pills!

30
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:27,719
Everything else was left to the men under me!

31
00:01:28,359 --> 00:01:29,079
Lian Ye...

32
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:32,640
Your father and I were business rivals,

33
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:36,120
but I always treated him like my own brother!

34
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,640
I only care about money!

35
00:01:37,719 --> 00:01:39,560
I... I would never take a life!

36
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,599
Brother?

37
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:45,120
You think just saying you didn't know

38
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,280
gets you off the hook?!

39
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:49,640
Then what about my family's lives back then?!

40
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,439
Lian Ye!

41
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,120
This is still just your conjecture!

42
00:01:52,319 --> 00:01:53,280
Without solid evidence,

43
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,319
my father is not the killer!

44
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,280
Bullshit! He's your father!

45
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:57,840
Of course you'd cover for him!

46
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,000
Put the gun down first!

47
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,640
I promise I will investigate this thoroughly!

48
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,079
Why the hell should I trust your family?!

49
00:02:02,879 --> 00:02:03,879
Just try pulling that trigger!

50
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,120
I will kill you! What are you doing?!

51
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,280
Put that gun down right now!

52
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:17,800
What do you think you're doing?

53
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,039
Put your guns down!

54
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:21,120
Put them down! Put them down!

55
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,159
I'll lower mine when he does.

56
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,360
I'll lower mine when he does.

57
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:26,759
I bet you won't shoot.

58
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,240
You think I won't?

59
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:33,879
Lian Ye, don't shoot!

60
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,919
You'll pay for murder with your life!

61
00:02:37,039 --> 00:02:39,439
If you die, who's going to look for Xiaoyu?

62
00:02:56,439 --> 00:02:57,479
Ming... Mingyuan.

63
00:02:57,639 --> 00:02:58,439
Mingyuan.

64
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:03,080
Vented your anger yet? If not, we can go another round.

65
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,039
I'll spare your life for now.

66
00:03:05,919 --> 00:03:06,879
The debt your family owes...

67
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,000
I'll settle it sooner or later.

68
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,759
Dali.

69
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:13,560
Let's go.

70
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,360
Thank you for tipping me off,

71
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,280
and sparing my father's life.

72
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,080
Brother Mingyuan.

73
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,080
Are you all right?

74
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:31,520
I'm fine.

75
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,680
Come on, let's go home.

76
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,360
The police cells aren't safe.

77
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,240
Just stay in this room for now.

78
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,400
Mingyuan...

79
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:01,919
I'm innocent!

80
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,319
You can't lock me up!

81
00:04:03,479 --> 00:04:05,879
The Charity Opium Cessation Clinic secretly sold raw opium.

82
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:08,560
As the boss behind it, you can't escape the blame.

83
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:09,680
I...

84
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,599
I know I was negligent,

85
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:14,240
but I never had any intention of dealing raw opium!

86
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:17,040
That's a wicked deed that curses one's lineage!

87
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,199
The Hainiang Temple Murder Case

88
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:20,399
was the result of the killer using addicted fishermen's corpses

89
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,759
to smuggle raw opium.

90
00:04:22,399 --> 00:04:22,920
This...

91
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,439
I can't believe it's true.

92
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,439
It really is tied to the cessation pills.

93
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,759
In the cessation pill business,

94
00:04:31,079 --> 00:04:32,160
you signed the orders,

95
00:04:32,439 --> 00:04:33,800
Boss Song handled sales.

96
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,360
Who handled transportation?

97
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,519
It... It's...

98
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,759
It's the Shipboard Guild.

99
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,040
The Shipboard Guild?

100
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:53,519
Who are you?

101
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,519
What do you want?

102
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,040
Boss Song.

103
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:58,439
Don't recognize me after just one day?

104
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:04,279
You're Boss Wang...

105
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,879
No, you're not Boss Wang.

106
00:05:09,879 --> 00:05:11,360
The Lian family's precious son...

107
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,600
That bastard...

108
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,120
That good-for-nothing...

109
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,519
Lian Ye.

110
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,120
Take the money, burn the goods.

111
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:18,920
Turn them over to the police.

112
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,600
Yes, sir.

113
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,879
Lian Ye acted on his own,

114
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:43,639
overstepped his authority, a grave error.

115
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:48,399
Suspended from managing Min River Wharf.

116
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,399
Mr. Matsui,

117
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:11,720
you sing Min opera quite well.

118
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:13,279
President Sun. President Sun. President Sun.

119
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:17,079
President Sun,

120
00:07:19,399 --> 00:07:22,399
do you know, besides Min opera,

121
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:25,720
what else I like about China?

122
00:07:26,879 --> 00:07:28,319
I'm just a roughneck.

123
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,399
How would I know such things?

124
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,399
Mr. Matsui, please just tell me.

125
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,759
It's Chinese chess.

126
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,120
The Chu River,

127
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:41,439
the Han Border,

128
00:07:42,439 --> 00:07:44,879
maneuvering across the board.

129
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,839
At critical moments: Sacrifice the chariot to save the general.

130
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:01,040
Captain,

131
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,360
do we really have to move in such a rush?

132
00:08:02,759 --> 00:08:04,040
Waiting until the heat blows over before shipping...

133
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:04,680
wouldn't that be safer?

134
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,560
What are you scared of?

135
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,040
Lian Ye isn't here.

136
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:08,560
Who dares to mess with me?

137
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:10,839
Open the crates for inspection!

138
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,720
You punk, looking for trouble, are you?

139
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:13,439
Xiaodao,

140
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,600
you little bastard!

141
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,000
Lian Ye isn't here.

142
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:21,600
What right do you have to touch my goods?

143
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,360
He doesn't have the right...

144
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:39,759
What about us?

145
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,200
Hold on.

146
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:47,360
Officer Li, as far as I know,

147
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:50,080
the shipping business at the docks

148
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:52,639
isn't under police jurisdiction, is it?

149
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:55,840
An informant tipped us off about raw opium smuggling.

150
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,720
This is a routine police inspection.

151
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:00,960
What's inside these crates

152
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:03,799
are the bodies of my deceased Shipboard Guild brothers.

153
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,440
They tragically died at sea.

154
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:09,200
Now I'm taking them home to be buried.

155
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:10,639
Officer Li,

156
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:15,799
surely the police wouldn't deny respect

157
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:18,000
even to the dead, would they?

158
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:20,039
Right, brothers?

159
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,200
That's right!

160
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,000
Starting from January this year,

161
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:25,720
the Shipboard Guild has shipped corpses

162
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:28,039
from Langqi Island every month,

163
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,000
for over half a year.

164
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:35,360
Where did your Shipboard Guild get so many dead men?

165
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,000
What's going on here?

166
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,120
No!

167
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:43,799
Open the crates!

168
00:09:51,159 --> 00:09:51,919
Cut open the bellies!

169
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,480
What else do you have to say?

170
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:20,879
Get him!

171
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:44,960
Come on! Come on!

172
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,039
The fish took the bait.

173
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,840
Well, well, Old Shen.

174
00:11:14,559 --> 00:11:15,720
You finally showed up.

175
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,120
Wait...

176
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,840
Weren't you suspended by the Sanshan Gang?

177
00:11:22,879 --> 00:11:24,759
When the King of Hell's away,

178
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:27,000
the little demons run wild.

179
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,240
If I hadn't been suspended,

180
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:33,200
how would you slip up so easily?

181
00:11:37,679 --> 00:11:38,759
You set me up!

182
00:11:39,159 --> 00:11:40,440
I wouldn't say that.

183
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:43,440
We've been dealing with each other

184
00:11:44,279 --> 00:11:45,559
for nearly two years now.

185
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,840
I know what kind of man you are.

186
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,279
Foul-mouthed,

187
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,440
ruthless,

188
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:52,759
but not sinister enough.

189
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:56,840
Using human lives to smuggle raw opium...

190
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,720
A scheme so utterly monstrous—

191
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,360
you couldn't have come up with it.

192
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,720
Given the situation,

193
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:05,960
just tell me honestly:

194
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,200
who is really pulling your strings?

195
00:12:11,879 --> 00:12:12,440
Get out of the way!

196
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,720
I said move!

197
00:12:16,639 --> 00:12:17,840
Won't move, huh?

198
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:21,399
Don't move!

199
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:22,240
Let me go!

200
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:23,240
Stay still!

201
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:29,559
Take him to the station!

202
00:12:30,039 --> 00:12:30,919
Get up!

203
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:34,559
Tieshan.

204
00:12:39,279 --> 00:12:40,440
President... President!

205
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,440
I made you Branch Leader

206
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:51,759
hoping you would stay out of trouble

207
00:12:51,759 --> 00:12:53,080
and do your job properly.

208
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,440
Never did I expect that for money,

209
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:59,039
you'd make such a grave mistake.

210
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:02,519
Even if you don't care about yourself,

211
00:13:02,639 --> 00:13:05,919
you should think of your young child and aging mother!

212
00:13:14,879 --> 00:13:15,600
Let me go!

213
00:13:15,799 --> 00:13:16,799
Let go of me!

214
00:13:16,799 --> 00:13:17,519
Don't move!

215
00:13:17,919 --> 00:13:18,559
Shen Tieshan!

216
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:19,399
What are you doing?

217
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:19,960
You...

218
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:21,399
you...

219
00:13:21,919 --> 00:13:23,759
and you... you too!

220
00:13:25,559 --> 00:13:26,279
Put your guns down!

221
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:28,759
Fine.

222
00:13:29,799 --> 00:13:30,720
All right.

223
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,120
President...

224
00:13:32,519 --> 00:13:34,600
Tieshan, put the gun down.

225
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,360
From this moment on,

226
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:45,279
your life belongs to me.

227
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:53,279
Fine.

228
00:14:03,399 --> 00:14:03,919
No!

229
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:40,360
This is the suicide note

230
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,440
we found in Shen Tieshan's home.

231
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,240
Shen Tieshan confessed

232
00:14:43,519 --> 00:14:45,639
that to support his young child and elderly mother,

233
00:14:45,919 --> 00:14:47,519
he did everything to make quick money.

234
00:14:48,279 --> 00:14:50,080
Using free opium as bait,

235
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:52,600
he lured addicted fishermen and porters

236
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,679
to Langqi Island,

237
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,080
murdered them,

238
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:57,480
and stuffed raw opium into their bellies.

239
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,759
Under the guise of bringing them back for burial,

240
00:14:59,879 --> 00:15:01,080
he bypassed customs inspections

241
00:15:01,559 --> 00:15:03,000
and smuggled the raw opium into Rongcheng.

242
00:15:03,679 --> 00:15:04,919
To cover his tracks,

243
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,559
he disguised himself as a water ghost to kill fishermen,

244
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:09,759
carved sea runes onto their foreheads,

245
00:15:10,279 --> 00:15:12,519
and made people believe it was a water ghost.

246
00:15:13,159 --> 00:15:15,559
After the murders, he spread rumors

247
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:16,960
of water ghost killings across the city.

248
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:20,000
Caught in the act once by Wan Jun,

249
00:15:20,399 --> 00:15:21,679
he later disguised himself as a police officer,

250
00:15:21,679 --> 00:15:22,279
"Please, I beg you!"

251
00:15:22,279 --> 00:15:24,960
sneaked into the jail, and killed him.

252
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,600
This suicide note

253
00:15:32,919 --> 00:15:35,360
explains the whole story clearly.

254
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:39,320
Let's close the Hainiang Temple Murder Case.

255
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:42,360
I think there are still doubts about this case.

256
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:45,799
First, as Branch Leader of the Shipboard Guild,

257
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,080
his wages were enough to support his family.

258
00:15:48,559 --> 00:15:49,960
Why risk trafficking raw opium?

259
00:15:50,399 --> 00:15:52,919
Second, the police station is heavily guarded.

260
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:55,240
How did he sneak in without a sound?

261
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:58,440
Deputy Chief Zhou, I feel this case—

262
00:15:58,919 --> 00:16:01,320
This case has already caused widespread panic!

263
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,159
The issues you raised

264
00:16:03,159 --> 00:16:05,600
cannot change the conclusion of the case.

265
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:08,720
What we need to do now is close it quickly

266
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,440
and give the people of Rongcheng an answer.

267
00:16:11,159 --> 00:16:11,960
Mingyuan,

268
00:16:12,399 --> 00:16:14,759
you've been promoted to captain of the detective squad.

269
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,440
It's a heavy responsibility.

270
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:18,919
Don't keep clinging to a single case,

271
00:16:18,919 --> 00:16:19,759
all right?

272
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,519
Hurry, hurry! Run!

273
00:16:27,639 --> 00:16:28,759
Go, quick!

274
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,919
It's... it's the Ghost Festival.

275
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,360
Stealing sacrificial offerings...

276
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,679
is that really a good idea?

277
00:16:35,759 --> 00:16:36,879
Eat it or don't!

278
00:16:36,879 --> 00:16:37,399
Exactly.

279
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:39,320
If you won't eat, we will.

280
